 quy\u7871\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 184/2019/NQ-H\'d0ND ng\'e0y 12/7/2019 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh ban h\'e0nh quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc chi ti\u7871\'3fp kh\'e1ch n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i, t\u7893\'3f ch
\u7913\'3fc h\u7897\'3fi ngh\u7883\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc t\u7871\'3f, chi ti\u7871\'3fp kh\'e1ch trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 quan, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\'ean \'f0\u7883\'3fa b\'e0n t\u7881\'3fnh V\u297\'3fnh Long; Ngh
