\u7897\'3f chi h\u7897\'3fi ngh\u7883\'3f tr\'ean \'f0\u7883\'3fa b\'e0n t\u7881\'3fnh V\u297\'3fnh Long.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs26\insrsid9837462\charrsid1916042 
