\'3fu m\u7889\'3fi \'fd\'f5m t\u7841\'3fo c\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f, \'fd\'f5m t\u7841\'3fo doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 c\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f: kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 80.000.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f/doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp. N
\u7897\'3fi dung c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\'fd v\u7845\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f Khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 C\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f.}
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs26\insrsid9837462\charrsid1916042 
