i s\'e1ng t\u7841\'3fo tr\u7843\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn c\'f4ng lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp; s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'e1c d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f kh\u7903\'3fi nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi s\'e1ng t\u7841\'3fo; s\u7917
\'3f d\u7909\'3fng kh\'f4ng gian s\u7889\'3f, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc tuy\u7871\'3fn; kinh ph\'ed s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft th\u7917\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fm, l\'e0m s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm m\u7851\'3fu, ho\'e0n thi
\u7879\'3fn c\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f v\'e0 tham gia c\'e1c kh\'f3a hu\u7845\'3fn luy\u7879\'3fn t\u7853\'3fp trung ng\u7855\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn \u7903\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i. Trong \'f0\'f3 \'fdu ti\'ean h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f kinh ph\'ed cho c\'e1
c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\u7903\'3fi nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi s\'e1ng t\u7841\'3fo c\'f3 th\'e0nh t\'edch xu\u7845\'3ft s\u7855\'3fc, \'f0\u7841\'3ft th\u7913\'3f h\u7841\'3fng cao t\u7841\'3fi cu\u7897\'3fc thi kh\u7903\'3fi nghi
\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi s\'e1ng t\u7841\'3fo trong c\'e1c s\u7921\'3f ki\u7879\'3fn kh\u7903\'3fi nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi s\'e1ng t\u7841\'3fo c\u7845\'3fp qu\u7889\'3fc gia ho\u7863\'3fc qu\u7889\'3fc t\u7871\'3f.}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs26\insrsid9837462\charrsid1916042 
